# ============================================================
# JEE Practice Hub — Environment Variables Template
# ============================================================
# IMPORTANT:
# - Variables prefixed with VITE_ are embedded into the client browser bundle.
# - VITE_SUPABASE_URL and VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY are designed to be public.
#   All data protection and tenant isolation are enforced by PostgreSQL Row-Level Security (RLS).
# - NEVER prefix backend secrets with VITE_.
# ============================================================

# ---- PUBLIC BROWSER VARIABLES (Vercel Project Settings) ----
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
VITE_APP_ENV=production
VITE_CAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=your-hcaptcha-or-turnstile-site-key-here

# ============================================================
# ---- SERVER-ONLY VARIABLES (SUPABASE SECRETS / BACKEND ONLY) ----
# Set via `supabase secrets set` or in the Supabase Dashboard.
# NEVER place these in Vercel client environment or git repository!
# ============================================================
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key-here
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.your-email-provider.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your-smtp-username
# SMTP_PASS=your-smtp-password
# SMTP_SENDER_EMAIL=noreply@yourdomain.com
# SMTP_SENDER_NAME="JEE Practice Hub"
# CAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY=your-captcha-secret-key-here
